---
source: crates/acpilot-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: stdout(&secret)
---
Store, list, and remove credentials in the OS keyring

Usage: acpilot secret <COMMAND>

Commands:
  set   Store a secret. Reads the value from stdin
  list  List the secrets this profile references, and whether they are set
  rm    Remove a secret
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
